# Wardrobe Scout: this repository holds the METHOD, never anyone's photos.
# The main protection is keeping your wardrobe/ folder OUTSIDE any git repository.
# The rules below are the second layer, so nobody pushes their face to a fork by accident.

# Personal working folders
wardrobe/
photos/
looks/

# Photos and generated images
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.heif
*.webp
*.avif

# The project page's own images stay tracked: Lucas, a synthetic person who does not exist,
# and screenshots of the fictional example. Only .webp and the social card, so a real photo
# dropped in site/ by mistake (.jpg, .png, .heic) is still ignored.
!site/img/*.webp
!site/img/og.jpg

# Personal lists (the fictional example in examples/ stays tracked)
finds.json
profile.md
!templates/profile.md
shopping-list.html

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets
.env
*.key

# Marketplace package, built by node pack/pack.mjs
wardrobe-scout.zip
